    },
    {
        "text": "<p=2>November 6th, 1100    3:20 P.M.</>",
        "tag": "animtext",
        "id": "at1",
        "name": "group_location_stamp",
        "style": "avg_only_medium",
        "pos": "-400,-200",
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "animtextclean"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1550_1#1$1",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm terribly sorry that you came all the way here for nothing, Signore.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Truck Driver"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_701_1#1$1",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Did she not tell you where she was going?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Judge's Assistant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1550_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, b-but please let Judge Lavinia know that Eirene is looking into her request in all earnestness.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Truck Driver"
    },
    {
        "text": "When she came back to camp, she asked us all to inspect all the association trucks. She should be investigating the accident right now\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Truck Driver"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_701_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright, calm down. I'm not here about that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Judge's Assistant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1550_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Eh? Then\u2014Oh, Lyudmila, do you know where Eirene went?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Truck Driver"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why're you being so sneaky? Nearly didn't notice you...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Truck Driver"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lyudmila"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1550_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "How'd your clothes get so torn up? Did you get in a fight?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Truck Driver"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...I tripped.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lyudmila"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_701_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you Lyudmila?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Judge's Assistant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lyudmila"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_701_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have something for you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Judge's Assistant"
    },
    {
        "text": "It should really be sent to Eirene so she can notify you, but since she's not here, giving it directly to you should work too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Judge's Assistant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What is it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lyudmila"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_701_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "A citizenship certificate and identity documentation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Judge's Assistant"
    },
    {
        "text": "You passed City Hall's and the court's background checks, and you've accumulated enough citizen points...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Judge's Assistant"
    },
    {
        "text": "From this day onwards, you are a legal citizen of Nuova Volsinii and formally registered in the Truckers' Union registrar of drivers, and are entitled to all rights stipulated in the New Urban Management Act.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Judge's Assistant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1550_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Haha, finally!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Truck Driver"
    },
    {
        "text": "You treated us to salt soda a day too early, Lyudmila!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Truck Driver"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lyudmila"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_701_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Surprised? We are aware of your *ahem* special circumstances.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Judge's Assistant"
    },
    {
        "text": "You still need to undergo regular Oripathy checkups. If your infection worsens, we will re-evaluate your treatment plan.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Judge's Assistant"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Truckers' Union holds a special position in this city. At first, it would have been quite difficult for you to pass the background checks...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Judge's Assistant"
    },
    {
        "text": "Eirene actually came over to City Hall and courthouse many times over this matter. She even made herself your guarantor, and many of your fellow drivers followed her and signed off your materials, too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Judge's Assistant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lyudmila"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1550_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, don't look at me like that, Lyudmila. We couldn't just let you treat us to food and drink forever.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Truck Driver"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_701_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Lyudmila?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Judge's Assistant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1550_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Look, no need to push her too hard, she's not the talkative sort. Why, when I got my cert and documents, I was probably way more shocked than she is.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Truck Driver"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_701_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I understand. According to our data, the uncle who took you in as a child was involved in a turf war, and his entire family was murdered. To be honest, everyone's got a story like that...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Judge's Assistant"
    },
    {
        "text": "After the founding of Nuova Volsinii, many Siracusans once under the yoke of the famiglie rushed over, obtaining new identities and breaking free of their influence.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Judge's Assistant"
    },
    {
        "text": "Many mafiosi have also broke free of their famiglie in this manner.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Judge's Assistant"
    },
    {
        "text": "In this city, we all have the right to escape our pasts and embrace new lives.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Judge's Assistant"
    },
    {
        "text": "Congratulations, Lyudmila.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Judge's Assistant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "posfrom": "0,0",
        "posto": "200,0",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Lyudmila silently stares at the certificate and documents in her hand."
    },
    {
