    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1547_1#2$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "'A chance encounter'... Now I'm not a cultured man, but these words... Don't you think they're about people like us?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sommer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "all"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1547_1#3$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "This really is a chance encounter between two sfortunati, haha.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sommer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1547_1#2$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Eirene always says life will show how much it cares for people with bad luck, it's just running a bit late is all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sommer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "curtain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "cameraeffect",
        "effect": "Grayscale",
        "fadetime": 0,
        "amount": 0,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "56_g9_truckcamp",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "musicvolume",
        "volume": 0.6,
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "So this is how life decides to repay the unfortunate...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lyudmila"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1550_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "posfrom": "0,0",
        "posto": "-200,0",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's gotten into you, Lyudmila?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Truck Driver"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Has Sommer shown up?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lyudmila"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "No. Hasn't he been on break from yesterday evening up 'til now? Maybe he's picking out Carnevale presents for Guri.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Truck Driver"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't make excuses for him, Ruggiero.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lyudmila"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know what's going on with the two of you. I was riding alongside him last night.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lyudmila"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Truck Driver"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$mist_intro",
        "key": "$mist_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "text": "You talking about the car crash last night?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Truck Driver"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mhm. That was our truck.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lyudmila"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "My God...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Truck Driver"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Based on the look on your face, he hasn't come back here. Know anywhere he might go? Think quick.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lyudmila"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "There was supposed to be a delivery to the service station near Dock #3 last night. At times, we'll also head over to some abandoned warehouses under Venezia Trucking...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Truck Driver"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've already checked them all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lyudmila"
    },
    {
        "text": "The scene of the crash was already cordoned off by the time I went back, and Sommer and the truck were both gone. After that, I searched the places you mentioned. Nothing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lyudmila"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lyudmila"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "How could I have left him there? Dammit. If I wasn't distracted by that wolf pup, maybe...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lyudmila"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Lyudmila...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Truck Driver"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll keep looking for him!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lyudmila"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
