        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you saying we're sending the floats off now?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Port Worker"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yep, they're all assembled anyway. Send them all to the expansion plate. That's where the Carnevale parade is starting.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dispatcher"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I knew that. What I meant was, weren't we meant to send them off at night?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Port Worker"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "That rainstorm pouring down all of a sudden earlier, remember? Not often we see such bad weather come by Nuova Volsinii. Who the hell knows if it'll rain again later today.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dispatcher"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's a dozen giant floats out on the move we're talking about. If they ran into that kind of weather, we'd have to do traffic control, and I'd rather not have to deal with that headache.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dispatcher"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I suppose that makes sense.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Port Worker"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "C'mon, sbrigati, while the rain's stopped.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dispatcher"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, right, you're going to be passing by a lot of places on the way. Remember to cover those floats with tarps. City Hall wants to keep their designs a mystery until the parade.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dispatcher"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Got it. I'll go call the boys over.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Port Worker"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "posfrom": "0,0",
        "posto": "250,0",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "posfrom": "0,0",
        "posto": "-200,0",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "afrom": 1,
        "ato": 0,
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "afrom": 1,
        "ato": 0,
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lyudmila"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "If Sommer could only go back the way he came, and he wanted to hide a truck in a port this busy... Don't tell me he...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lyudmila"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "posfrom": "0,0",
        "posto": "-350,0",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "style": "slider",
        "inverse": true,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "style": "slider",
        "inverse": false,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "In a corner of Nuova Volsinii's port, a dozen or so mobile cranes are hoisting up giant tarpaulins, creating a labyrinth out of thin air, sealed away from the outside."
    },
    {
        "text": "Under the tarps, a dozen oddly-shaped giant beasts sleep silently. Ere their resurrection at Carvenale, this is their cemetery."
    },
    {
        "text": "Lyudmila passes by them. She is not in the mood to investigate these strange constructs. She walks directly to the end of their procession and stops."
    },
    {
        "text": "There lies a great wolf. Vast amounts of imitation fur cover the truck underneath its frame. Its tail oh-so-conveniently droops down over the eye-catching dents and gouges of the truck's carriage."
    },
    {
        "text": "It bares its fangs in soundless snarl, guarding the secrets hidden below its body."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lyudmila"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_trnpndor"
    },
    {
        "text": "She pulls open the door to the truck's container. She is greeted by a pile of black tires, alongside..."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lyudmila"
    },
    {
        "tag": "musicvolume",
        "volume": 0.4,
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "curtain",
        "direction": 0,
        "fillfrom": 0.1,
        "fillto": 0.1,
        "fadetime": 0.1
    },
    {
        "tag": "curtain",
        "direction": 4,
        "fillfrom": 0.1,
        "fillto": 0.1,
        "fadetime": 0.1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1547_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "cameraeffect",
        "effect": "Grayscale",
        "fadetime": 0,
        "keep": true,
        "initamount": 0,
        "amount": 0.7,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "56_g2_newvolsiniistreet_n",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "What're you delivering for the Venezias?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lyudmila"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1547_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's a batch of tires tonight.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sommer"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's usually stuff for making vehicles. Originium engines, steel, alloys, things like that. At times there's also frozen fins, frozen meat, booze, meds...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sommer"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's pretty common in other Siracusan cities. Goods the famiglie buy don't have to go through normal customs, so they save a lot on taxes. But here in Nuova Volsinii\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sommer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "curtain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "cameraeffect",
        "effect": "Grayscale",
        "fadetime": 0,
        "amount": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "56_g11_newvolsiniipier",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "musicvolume",
        "volume": 0.6,
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Lyudmila pulls out her dagger, running it against the seam in the tire she spotted just now. She slashes at the thick rubber, revealing what lies hidden within."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Guns, staves, crossbows, even Originium explosives...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lyudmila"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sommer, you idiot. Did you know you were transporting this kind of 'merchandise'?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lyudmila"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Pizdets! This is suddenly a lot more complicated than smuggling tires and crashing into the Acting Mayor! Wait, someone's coming.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lyudmila"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "posfrom": "0,0",
        "posto": "-200,0",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0.2,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "It should be here somewhere.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoarse Voice"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll take that side, Gambino. You look here. Veloce, veloce.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoarse Voice"
    },
    {
        "text": "Capone, did you ever think about how we're going to explain to Venezia junior where we picked up this trail, assuming we do?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loud Voice"
    },
    {
        "text": "I mean, surely we can't just say Lappland told us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loud Voice"
    },
    {
        "text": "Actually, I'm more worried about how that crazy pazza even knew Sommer stashed his truck in the port...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoarse Voice"
    },
    {
        "text": "What the hell is she cooking up here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoarse Voice"
    },
    {
        "text": "Fuhgeddaboutit! No point thinking about that crap, just get back to work\u2014Wait, I think the polizia's outside! Hide!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loud Voice"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$transmission",
        "volume": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Sir. It's me, Noemi.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sweet Voice"
    },
    {
        "text": "Have you found anything on your end?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sweet Voice"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't drink coffee. It's too bitter.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sweet Voice"
    },
    {
        "text": "C'mon, let's stay focused on the task at hand. I know the truck we're looking for is hidden around here somewhere! Get over here, quickly!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sweet Voice"
    },
    {
        "text": "Right, the west side of the port, where the floats are being stored!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sweet Voice"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_truckengine",
        "loop": true,
        "channel": "bgs",
        "volume": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "soundvolume",
        "volume": 0.5,
        "channel": "bgs",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": "bgs",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait, the dockhands are starting to...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lyudmila"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Lyudmila hears the sound of cranes pulling away at the tarps, and the engine of the vehicle up ahead starting up."
    },
    {
        "text": "Both the mafiosi and the police are close by. This float, its secret, Sommer, and the truck drivers' 'new lives' are about to be exposed to the light of day."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Blyat!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lyudmila"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_paper2",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Lyudmila's hand brushes past her side, and she feels a damp spot in her pocket. It's the documents she folded up and stuffed in there, proof that she is now one of those idiots."
    },
    {
        "text": "They must have gotten soaked in the rain as she ran to the port. She didn't have time to stash them away in her tent when she left camp."
    },
    {
        "text": "Caught in the autumn rain again, she snaps back to reality. It's getting cold, she thinks."
    },
    {
        "text": "It would be great if she could warm herself up by a fire right now."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "cameraeffect",
        "effect": "Grayscale",
        "fadetime": 0,
        "keep": true,
        "initamount": 0,
        "amount": 0.7,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "char_1502_crowns",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_iceforest_2",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$distressed_intro",
        "key": "$distressed_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Look at this bonfire out here among the snow, friend. Once, it could ignite the anger of the Infected. It could spark the dream of Reunion. It could set all of Ursus ablaze.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lyudmila"
    },
    {
        "text": "But now, all it does is keep us warm.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lyudmila"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_wilderness_m",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0.6,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "'First, learn how to light a fire. Burn down this house and everything in it, so that nobody can find us.'",
        "x": 100,
        "y": 300,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "'Fire hides everything, Lyudmila.'",
        "x": 100,
        "y": 300,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
