        "amount": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "image",
        "image": "56_i03",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "xScale": 1.2,
        "yScale": 1.2,
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "imagetween",
        "xScaleTo": 1,
        "yScaleTo": 1,
        "duration": 45,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Lyudmila stands in a shadow not too far away, silently watching the blaze lick away at the carriage. It rises, engulfing the entirety of the great wolf."
    },
    {
        "text": "Fire can ignite anger. It can spark a dream. It can also bury everything in ash."
    },
    {
        "text": "And her own smoke can help conceal the fire. Before anyone else catches on, she can let it build into a towering inferno, inextinguishable."
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lyudmila"
    },
    {
        "text": "*sigh* I'm one ragazza sfortunata.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lyudmila"
    },
